{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Staged</strong> is an online co-op chaos game where you and up to three other players rebuild theater stages using physics-based props, proximity voice chat, and teamwork that constantly falls apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/2eff0473b91a77e8b93f3f3694251fb1.poster.avif?t=1773423862\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/2eff0473b91a77e8b93f3f3694251fb1.webm?t=1773423862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/2eff0473b91a77e8b93f3f3694251fb1.mp4?t=1773423862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PUT ON THE SHOW</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recreate complex stage sets based on visual references. Search storage rooms, operate machinery, and transport props through tight backstage areas. Every object must be placed correctly before the curtain rises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/2b39028871c8f02701bf9d986f4b6bc9.poster.avif?t=1773423862\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/2b39028871c8f02701bf9d986f4b6bc9.webm?t=1773423862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/2b39028871c8f02701bf9d986f4b6bc9.mp4?t=1773423862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WORK TOGETHER OR MAKE IT WORSE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some props are impossible to handle alone. Lift, stabilize, mount, and assemble stage equipment together while managing parallel tasks under time pressure. Coordination is required. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/3b627e3195966ca7bd9ceb15f86a0112.poster.avif?t=1773423862\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/3b627e3195966ca7bd9ceb15f86a0112.webm?t=1773423862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/3b627e3195966ca7bd9ceb15f86a0112.mp4?t=1773423862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE STAGE FIGHTS BACK</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unexpected events can interrupt your setup. Power failures can plunge the stage into darkness, forcing players to navigate with flashlights and manually restore systems before the performance begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/67d2404f3a6b6dd487cf7628b9ab7b19.poster.avif?t=1773423862\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/67d2404f3a6b6dd487cf7628b9ab7b19.webm?t=1773423862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/67d2404f3a6b6dd487cf7628b9ab7b19.mp4?t=1773423862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMMUNICATION MATTERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice chat limits communication to distance. Players separated across the theater must improvise, relay information, and deal with misunderstandings in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/6c6f89a504471c62d3072b22c88629e4.poster.avif?t=1773423862\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/6c6f89a504471c62d3072b22c88629e4.webm?t=1773423862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/6c6f89a504471c62d3072b22c88629e4.mp4?t=1773423862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ACT. BUILD. GET RATED.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level consists of multiple acts with new stage layouts. After every performance, your reconstruction is evaluated based on accuracy, positioning, rotation, and technical setup. Earn ratings and progress to more complex productions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op for 1\u20134 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-driven prop handling and stage construction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice chat affecting gameplay coordination</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-act levels with changing stage scenarios</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random disruptive events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasingly complex theater environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperative machinery, cranes, and technical systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Performance rating system based on precision and execution</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3534100?t=1773423862","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/88097945afb73d3572fd225e7931d0d618912a7f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773423862","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/59ad74ec5dce4a2cf7755efb691cbd5c88d910c8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773423862","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/59ad74ec5dce4a2cf7755efb691cbd5c88d910c8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773423862","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Staged</strong> is an online co-op chaos game where you and up to three other players rebuild theater stages using physics-based props, proximity voice chat, and teamwork that constantly falls apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/2eff0473b91a77e8b93f3f3694251fb1.poster.avif?t=1773423862\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/2eff0473b91a77e8b93f3f3694251fb1.webm?t=1773423862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/2eff0473b91a77e8b93f3f3694251fb1.mp4?t=1773423862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PUT ON THE SHOW</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recreate complex stage sets based on visual references. Search storage rooms, operate machinery, and transport props through tight backstage areas. Every object must be placed correctly before the curtain rises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/2b39028871c8f02701bf9d986f4b6bc9.poster.avif?t=1773423862\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/2b39028871c8f02701bf9d986f4b6bc9.webm?t=1773423862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/2b39028871c8f02701bf9d986f4b6bc9.mp4?t=1773423862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WORK TOGETHER OR MAKE IT WORSE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some props are impossible to handle alone. Lift, stabilize, mount, and assemble stage equipment together while managing parallel tasks under time pressure. Coordination is required. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/3b627e3195966ca7bd9ceb15f86a0112.poster.avif?t=1773423862\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/3b627e3195966ca7bd9ceb15f86a0112.webm?t=1773423862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/3b627e3195966ca7bd9ceb15f86a0112.mp4?t=1773423862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE STAGE FIGHTS BACK</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unexpected events can interrupt your setup. Power failures can plunge the stage into darkness, forcing players to navigate with flashlights and manually restore systems before the performance begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/67d2404f3a6b6dd487cf7628b9ab7b19.poster.avif?t=1773423862\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/67d2404f3a6b6dd487cf7628b9ab7b19.webm?t=1773423862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/67d2404f3a6b6dd487cf7628b9ab7b19.mp4?t=1773423862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMMUNICATION MATTERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice chat limits communication to distance. Players separated across the theater must improvise, relay information, and deal with misunderstandings in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/6c6f89a504471c62d3072b22c88629e4.poster.avif?t=1773423862\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/6c6f89a504471c62d3072b22c88629e4.webm?t=1773423862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/6c6f89a504471c62d3072b22c88629e4.mp4?t=1773423862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ACT. BUILD. GET RATED.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level consists of multiple acts with new stage layouts. After every performance, your reconstruction is evaluated based on accuracy, positioning, rotation, and technical setup. Earn ratings and progress to more complex productions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op for 1\u20134 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-driven prop handling and stage construction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice chat affecting gameplay coordination</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-act levels with changing stage scenarios</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random disruptive events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasingly complex theater environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperative machinery, cranes, and technical systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Performance rating system based on precision and execution</p></li></ul>","developers":["Project Sunset"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/153fe54a8d4e5d61366c00a2088371b65a423668/header.jpg?t=1773423862","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3534100/270317230/de5ae908627068c7234fa0272702c4941b81238f/1772019190/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773423861","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3534100/270317230/de5ae908627068c7234fa0272702c4941b81238f/1772019190/dash_h264.mpd?t=1773423861","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3534100/270317230/de5ae908627068c7234fa0272702c4941b81238f/1772019190/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1773423861","id":257291907,"name":"Steam Next Fest Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257291907/b32300376f4065d0b3be700d09fd4a1889c893ad/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1773423861"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3534100/1754954204/11d1f5738966bf5282c2c2bd0166bdcc23f281bf/1758139213/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758144279","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3534100/1754954204/11d1f5738966bf5282c2c2bd0166bdcc23f281bf/1758139213/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758144279","highlight":false,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3534100/1754954204/11d1f5738966bf5282c2c2bd0166bdcc23f281bf/1758139213/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758144279","id":257180773,"n